"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974888_1729975291163866_2648731533470094025_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ltC6-5HfwpwQ7kNvwGM2dUF&_nc_oc=AdkihV9NpCsMtZjMRM91f7eiORMPrLq7AjqARh21_jgBbHB3PNIrqWT3WK-oeM_2-Wo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afs0Z8Yvb8nHvoMixHo1NYkzv1zYAdza0WasbPCsbrmiaw&oe=69A98EB8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-NPC Opponent.png", "id": "1021545086090699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_1021545099424031_6694415027269339898_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vJQRsSkBnFIQ7kNvwEU7FM6&_nc_oc=Adn2YdsbRSdG8wypV6pPK022sLg6IFF3PRWgG77Fhp0pZ0J1eI7jJWvxbZ-t9O8_UIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afugr07Rw8-H-tsKchLRez16SXFZhceLD4IgIqRNUigtTw&oe=69A9854F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-Arena.png", "id": "855040766578683", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982581_855040773245349_6076818306779792022_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wRPutRHQFmMQ7kNvwHSVqYH&_nc_oc=Adl3RvkNzaAIAtCb-cm25dBTTVoQ4gRAkPc2wm09TqvSZdipDBBCH5zRBWvzmtIxVM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftUj3pa67rS94FHhM3sfPJfNyoKsR0kRxJmuEhfz1eQUQ&oe=69A96D34"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-LobbyMenu.png", "id": "510941114868041", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984466_510941118201374_9006863217060690995_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y9SBGSR_n10Q7kNvwGbXlLb&_nc_oc=Admz_g5TkMF5eooXLuxBcQSa3cPjjdrZ6ZyVp9ohMKdagtBum2GPF3iCLrNxlr-55Is&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afvx69TVyFLCR5YU5Bb1kCBaHWyyTdbXIgS6ZnfXzpmeGA&oe=69A9809F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-BigPieces.png", "id": "855861089460800", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001708_855861092794133_914761184506848463_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=00z-7IER46AQ7kNvwEF8vhy&_nc_oc=AdlPRydBF-yQcy-1HTWs0ZpZknCVdMzr2isWBEdCKaBQqIlYBgHjQxZGxhvFys00L1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuTSQWaxLHf_ukrYyqOvzXYUXckJOSzCBniEuduCDf1XQ&oe=69A97BC4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Video_Cover_2.png", "id": "1661466311394678", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001733_1661466314728011_603153942027164803_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=er3l2S5f2_gQ7kNvwFWiEoq&_nc_oc=AdnkkDCn5GMwHC5lEiEaSlvLtxO3yjsQMSCCH5hwcEYEo6P7-bNftKGexC1UtTK94yE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afu9alWaWpGalRlaIl_bbT5yO_SItGSIbSqlCpriw_lJ3g&oe=69A97FB9"}, "display_name": "Merlin's Chess", "keywords": ["chess", "wizard", "strategy", "magic", "boardgame"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udca1 \"This is what chess in VR was meant to be!\"\n\n\ud83d\udca1 \"For anyone who's ever touched a chessboard, this is an absolute must-play!\"\n\n**Step into the world of Merlin's Chess, where strategy meets magic!**\n\nMerlin's Chess is a fantasy-themed VR chess game brings a completely new gameplay experience to the greatest strategy game ever. Explore an immersive and enchanting way to play chess.\n\n# Rich Set of Features\n\n- **\ud83d\udca5 Animated Chess Pieces:** Experience massive, animated chess pieces coming to life and clashing each other with captivating visual and sound effects.\n- **\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice Commands:** Command your pieces with your voice. Many other in-game voice commands are also supported.\n- **\ud83c\udf0d Matchmaking:** Find worthy opponents from around the world who match your skill level.\n- **\ud83e\udd16 Play vs. AI:** Challenge AI NPCs with a wide range of difficulty levels.\n- **\ud83c\udfae Game Modes:** Multiple game modes to serve every need. **Casual Mode** for a calm experience, **Ranked Mode** if feeling competitive, and upcoming **Puzzle Mode**!\n- **\ud83c\udf7f Spectator Mode:** Join ongoing games as spectator, hangout with other players, and feel the competition.\n- **\ud83c\udfc6 Rating System**: Pro-grade rating system for competitive matches. \n- **\ud83c\udff0 Fancy Content**: Seasonal Themes, New Match Environments, New Piece Sets, New Command Stations. Always fresh and inspiring!\n - **\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffd\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83d\udc68\ud83c\udffb Social by Default:** Customizable Avatars, Voice Chat, and Friendship System.", "short_description": "\ud83d\udca1 \"This is what chess in VR was meant to be!\"\n\nMerlin's Chess offers an immersive and enchanting way to play chess with a rich feature set including a variety of game modes, animated chess pieces, multiplayer gameplay, voice commands, AI opponents, piece sets, match environments, spectator mode, and additional DLC support for exciting new themes."}]}, "developer_name": "Teleporter Realities", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "MechaTurtle Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://merlinschess.gg/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "8016743785083375"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 16, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1328668021999099"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "125268079299